  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "A disabled on start gameobject with a graph using InputUse, will permanently not fire any \"InputUse\" events on any other world upon exiting the world with the disabled gameobject. Restarting the game fixes it.\nFrom these pictures, Only picture \"B\" works. It only seems to break if the GameObject the graph is on starts disabled.\nTo clarify: The event \"InputUse\" still fires when you are in the world, but when you exit the world, or enter the same world again it never detects any \"InputUse\" until you restar VRChat, on any world that uses that event.\nAs a side note: The Udon behaviour still works, as I can fire other events in the same behaviour (not shown on pictures) But ONLY InputUse never fires again on any world until restart.\nSDK: 2021.04.21.11.57\nBuild: 1093 (not beta)",
